```mermaid
%% BPMN-style flow describing zero-downtime migration steps.
flowchart LR
    A([Draft migration & seed]) --> B{Schema change type?}
    B -- Additive --> C[Write expand migration<br/>(new tables/columns/indexes)]
    B -- Breaking --> D[Design expand-migrate-contract plan<br/>with feature flags]
    C --> E[Run supabase db reset locally]
    D --> E
    E --> F[Execute npm run validate]
    F --> G[Apply to staging via supabase db push]
    G --> H[Capture EXPLAIN ANALYZE snapshots]
    H --> I{Checks pass?}
    I -- No --> J[Roll back / adjust migration]
    I -- Yes --> K[Deploy to production window]
    K --> L[Monitor Grafana + alerts]
    L --> M[Update ADRs, runbooks, Kaizen log]
```
